{"words": [{"text": "بِسْمِ", "translation": "In (the) name"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحْمَـٰنِ", "translation": "the Most Gracious"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّحِيمِ", "translation": "the Most Merciful"}], "sahih": "In the name of Allāh,1 the Entirely Merciful, the Especially Merciful.2"}